    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-jiangbingzhi:received_sentence2-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "iuq_5o2_wum_AA",
      "source_quote": "高祖督徐州，轉主簿，仍為世子中軍參軍。",
      "reading": "劉裕督徐州時為主簿，又為世子義符參軍。",
      "note": "劉裕督徐州時為主簿，又為世子義符參軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-jiangbingzhi:p002",
