    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-092-jiangbingzhi:received_sentence2-78",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "iuq_5o2_wum_AA",
      "source_quote": "少帝即位，入為尚書都官郎，出為永世、烏程令，以善政著名東土。",
      "reading": "少帝即位，任都官郎、永世令及烏程令。",
      "note": "少帝即位，任都官郎、永世令及烏程令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-jiangbingzhi:p002",
